{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测经 proc 转储凭据的可疑读操作。对应需求：凭据转储。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux经proc疑似转储凭据","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n读取 /proc 下与凭据相关的内存映射。\n\n### 为何重要\n属于无文件落地的凭据收集。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与时间是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://github.com/huntergregal/mimipenguin","https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2018-20781"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"ef100a2e-ecd4-4f72-9d1e-2f779ff3c311","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络/文件事件，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认"],"type":"eql","query":"sequence by host.id, process.parent.name with maxspan=1m\n  [process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and process.name == \"ps\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"start\", \"exec_event\")\n   and process.args in (\"-eo\", \"pid\", \"command\")]\n  [process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and process.name == \"strings\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"start\", \"exec_event\")\n   and process.args : \"/tmp/*\"]\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1003","name":"OS Credential Dumping","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1003.007","name":"Proc Filesystem","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/007/"}]},{"id":"T1212","name":"Exploitation for Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1212/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1057","name":"Process Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1057/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007"